whereami, in several languages

The Rust, C#, Java, F# and Clojure programs in this repository are ports of
whereami by George Mandis:

    https://github.com/georgemandis/whereami
    (based on commit f4bff19, version 0.4.0)

They reproduce its behavior, messages and structure, and the Windows backends
follow its src/platform/windows.zig. The original is included unchanged, as a
git submodule, at original/whereami. whereami is distributed under the
